  "understanding": "Four reusable phase skills will coordinate clarification, specifications, approved execution and final delivery. The report gains a readable complete task record. The user authorized this refactor through completion in D5; no further approval pause applies to this task. Future substantive tasks retain two approval gates.",
  "boundaries": [
    "Preserve strict UI reuse, historical snapshots, task records and artifact protection.",
    "No host installations, other-project changes, remote tracker actions, commits or publication.",
    "Actual model behavior and unavailable browser checks are reported separately from package tests."
